  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "updateDataModel": {
      "surfaceId": "state_walkthrough",
      "path": "/",
      "value": {
        "title": "### Template 4: Failure-Mode & State-Machine Walkthrough",
        "diagram": "Verify transition policies and retry bounds:\n\n$$T_{\text{backoff}}(k) = \\min\\left(T_{\\max},\\; T_0 \\cdot 2^k + \\mathcal{U}(0, J)\right)$$\n\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> Queued\n    Queued --> Leasing: acquire_lease()\n    Leasing --> Running: lease_granted\n    Running --> Retrying: transient_error (E_NET)\n    Retrying --> Queued: backoff_elapsed\n    Running --> DeadLetter: k >= K_max (E_POISON)\n    Running --> Completed: ack_success\n```",
        "transitions": {
          "t1": {
            "desc": "**Transition `Running -> Leasing` (Heartbeat Timeout)**\nWorker loses network partition while holding lease $L_i$.",
            "policy": [
              "fencing_token"
            ],
            "maxRetries": 3,
            "flag": true
          },
          "t2": {
            "desc": "**Transition `Running -> Retrying` (Partial Sub-Batch Failure)**\n3 of 50 records fail downstream validation.",
            "policy": [
              "split_subset"
            ],
            "maxRetries": 5
          },
          "t3": {
            "desc": "**Transition `Running -> DeadLetter` (Deterministic Deserialization Error)**\nPayload fails schema validation on first attempt.",
            "policy": [
              "immediate_dlq"
            ],
            "flag": true
          }
        },
        "labels": {
          "slider1": "Max Lease Re-acquisitions (K_max)",
          "slider2": "Max Subset Retries (K_max)",
          "flag1": "Emit structured audit event on epoch mismatch",
          "flag3": "Page on-call if DLQ rate exceeds 1% of throughput"
        },
        "submitLabel": "Confirm State-Machine Policies"
      }
    }
